Error [E0109]: `loop (x, y) in` on `Iter<(a: Int, b: String)>` needs one loop name, not two
  --> loop_zip_two_bindings.jet:4:20
    |
  4 |     loop (a, b) in xs.zip(ys) {
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: This iterator yields one item per step; only maps and indexed sequences yield a pair
 Fix: Use one loop name for this source
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
